{
  "version": 3,
  "_note": "Bundled detection rules. Structure only: no text is ever read. A short-video screen is a container that fills the window and whose current item fills the container (full-screen pages), scrolling vertically. pagerIdHints are view-id fragments that only raise confidence; the structure must still match, so a wrong guess can't cause counts on its own. verifiedVersions lists target-app versionCode ranges that passed the device test protocol; empty until then. countOnlyMainFeed: swipes count only while the app's bottom navigation is on screen (main feed), not in a viewer opened from search or a profile; set only for apps where a real phone showed the difference.",
